# The pre-purge archive. Holds 902 alerts and 236 personal names (UBO records)
# retained as evidence that the purge was performed correctly. Personal data
# under GDPR, and git history is effectively permanent — it must never be
# committed. Keep it wherever Compliance retains records, not here.
archive/

